    "instructions": "# components MCP (v1.0.0)\n\nMCP access to the Reflex app **components** and its 15 event handler(s).\n\nThe app is served at http://localhost:3131.\n\n## Authentication\n\nRequests require an app-issued Bearer token. For an anonymous session (no user identity; only public surfaces when the app enforces auth), POST to the app's token endpoint `/_reflex/auth/token` and use the returned `access_token` as your Bearer token. The session is server-generated and bound to the token; reuse the token across calls to address the same session.\n\n## Tools\n\n- `search_events(query)` -- Search the app's event handlers; returns each handler's name (for queue_event) and payload schema.\n- `queue_event(event_name, payload, query)` -- Apply an event to your session: event_name + payload (the handler's parameters) + optional query (a JSON object of query parameters, e.g. the dynamic route variables listed below). Returns the resulting state delta -- or, for a file-upload handler, out-of-band upload directions (files must be POSTed to the MCP upload endpoint separately).\n- `get_pending_updates()` -- Return and clear followup deltas buffered for the session (chained events, background-task results).\n\n## Resources\n\nIntrospect and read the app over `reflex://` resources:\n\n- `reflex://state` -- list the exposed state names.\n- `reflex://event` -- enumerate the event handlers; `reflex://event/<event_name>` -- one handler's full schema.\n- `reflex://state/events/<state_name>` -- the event handlers on a state.\n- `reflex://state/vars/<state_name>` -- the resolved `.dict()` rooted at a state (cached frontend + computed var values); read the root `reflex___state____state` for the whole app.\n- `reflex://state/vars/<state_name>/<var_name>` -- a single var's live value (a computed var is marked dirty and recomputed).\n\nExposed states (for the `<state_name>` above):\n\n- `reflex___state____state`\n- `reflex___state____state.components___components____agent_state`\n- `reflex___state____state.components___components____grid_state`\n- `reflex___state____state.components___fly_to_location____fly_to_location_state`\n- `reflex___state____state.components___formatter_demo___formatters____row_click_counter_state`\n- `reflex___state____state.components___saved_state____grid_serialization_advanced_state`\n\nCall search_events (or read `reflex://event`) to find an event and its payload schema, queue_event to apply it to your session, then read `reflex://state/vars/<state_name>` to inspect the resulting state.\n\n## App resources\n\nApp-defined, read-only resources returning a value from your session state. Each parameter is a required URI path segment.\n\n- `state-resource://components___components____agent_state/summary/{label}` -- Return a parameterized read-only summary.\n\n## Pages\n\n- `http://localhost:3131/index`\n- `http://localhost:3131/suppress-overlay`\n- `http://localhost:3131/charts`\n- `http://localhost:3131/grouping`\n- `http://localhost:3131/infinite`\n- `http://localhost:3131/server-side`\n- `http://localhost:3131/formatters-direct`\n- `http://localhost:3131/formatters`\n- `http://localhost:3131/fly-to-location`\n- `http://localhost:3131/map-controls`\n- `http://localhost:3131/advanced-serialization` -- on_load triggers `components___saved_state____grid_serialization_advanced_state.load_data`\n- `http://localhost:3131/vector-layers`",
    "tools": [
      "search_events",
      "queue_event",
      "get_pending_updates"
    ],
